    "title": "「手机端」新增仓库",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<ul>\n<li>智慧记AI进销存单店版、多店版支持多仓库</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>1. 启用多仓库：</strong> 【我的】→【设置】→【基础设置】→ 开启【多仓库】按钮。\n<img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202601/a57f6190277cea085689108eed10f2f2.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><strong>2. 新增仓库：</strong>【我的】→【店铺管理】→【仓库管理】-右上角【+】-填入仓库信息后，点击右上角【保存】。\n<img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202601/b5b62ddfe448a88b84c84661ec1151ff.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
